WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.628
Danner:
We got a dead body and a 
lot of people to talk to.

00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:03.921
What's your name, 
you fine as He-

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:04.922
-Sebastian.
-Travis.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.634
[phone buzzes]

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:10.302
Look who decided to call.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:11.845
Danner:
Has there been another murder?

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:14.598
Ha!
Uh, actually...

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.393
[screams]

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:20.354
[falling]

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:23.190
Hit me with that Aniq 
rom-com sequel.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.566
This is not a sequel.

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:27.611
♪ "It's My Party" 
by Leslie Gore ♪

00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:30.239
Aniq:
Number one suspect is the
bride, Zoe's sister.

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:31.615
♪ Cry if I want to ♪

00:00:31.615 --> 00:00:32.616
Grace didn't do it.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.827
Danner:
We got a dead body and a whole
lotta people to talk to.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:37.454
What's your name? 
You fine as hell.

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:38.538
-Sebastian.
-Travis.

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:41.124
♪ You would cry too ♪

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:43.835
Danner:
We'd like to hear your accounts
of what happened.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:46.630
I like to call them 
your mind movies.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.053
Travis:
She was all trouble. 
And for the record-

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.931
Travis:
the case wasn't the only thing
that was hard.

00:00:55.931 --> 00:00:56.807
Oh, God.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.685
Aniq:
Everyone here had a motive.

00:01:00.644 --> 00:01:04.147
I have many tales to tell.

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:06.733
Actually, maybe you could just
start from the beginning of the
wedding.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:07.609
I'm a searcher.

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:08.068
Okay.

00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:12.698
Edgar is a crumb. 
And Grace knows that I'm-

00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:14.408
What's that?

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.368
Pretty handy with a broom. 
That was a broom.

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:18.453
That's how I can tell you've
never swept before.

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:19.538
It's like a lightsaber.

00:01:21.123 --> 00:01:23.125
Happy birthday!

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:26.420
Oh, it's actually my Adoption
Day. I don't know when I was
born.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:27.963
♪ Cry if I want to ♪

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:29.172
This looks delicious.

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:30.257
That's potpourri.

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:31.425
Ah, Bon Appetit.

00:01:32.384 --> 00:01:34.094
You know you're eating air
freshener.

00:01:34.261 --> 00:01:35.053
Mmm!

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:35.971
[camera flashing]

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:36.763
Aniq:
Anyone could have done it.

00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:41.476
My mother says hello.

00:01:43.729 --> 00:01:46.440
Edgar:
She wanted to be here, but she
was busy with silence and alcohol.

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:47.899
♪ It's my party, 
and I'll cry if I want to ♪

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:50.027
Let us raise a toast 
to the happy couple.

00:01:50.402 --> 00:01:53.989
Travis:
This whole thing is so much more
complex than you guys realize.

00:01:53.989 --> 00:01:55.866
♪ Cry if I want to ♪

00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:58.285
We all have our secrets.

00:01:58.285 --> 00:01:59.119
[growling]

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.370
Yeah!

00:02:03.165 --> 00:02:05.125
Well, I think it's pretty clear-

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.335
-We got our guy.
-That's not our guy.

00:02:06.335 --> 00:02:07.794
What did you say? Got or not?

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:08.295
Not.

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:08.670
What?

00:02:09.338 --> 00:02:12.841
♪ You would cry too, 
if it happened to you ♪

00:02:12.841 --> 00:02:14.634
Well, I know who killed Edgar.

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:17.262
[whispering]

00:02:17.262 --> 00:02:20.724
When rich white people whisper,
it's never a good thing.

